# 换行策略：仓库内一律以 LF 存储，检出到工作区用 CRLF
# 本项目是 Windows 下的 WinForms（net472），设计器与 VS 默认都用 CRLF；
# 显式声明后，core.autocrlf 的取值就不再影响结果，也不会再出现
#   warning: LF will be replaced by CRLF in xxx.cs
* text=auto eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止做换行转换与文本合并
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
